// Windows resource script for the FABLE launcher icon.
//
// Compiled by build.rs (embed_fable_icon) via rc.exe, then LINKED ONLY into the
// `fable` binary. Declares the F at RT_GROUP_ICON id 1: Windows shows the icon
// with the LOWEST group id, so fable.exe displays the F while wupi.exe keeps the
// paw (its sole icon, at id 32512 from tauri-build's crate-wide resource.lib).
//
// NOTE: rc.exe ALSO emits one RT_ICON *image* entry per .ico size, numbered from
// 1 — which would collide with resource.lib's paw images (also numbered from 1)
// → `CVT1100: duplicate resource. type:ICON, name:1`. build.rs offsets those
// image ids (+ the group's nID refs) past the paw range AFTER compiling this
// (see offset_icon_image_ids); this .rc only sets the GROUP id.
// Generated by `python scripts/make-fable-icon.py`.
1 ICON "fable.ico"
